{"unit_id":"MuzeWinter__dscomputer-control#card-zh","repo":"MuzeWinter/dscomputer-control","commit":"a4b36c59a1009c832c6ee738b540611d183ed446","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dscomputer-control 为 DeepSeek Harness Desktop 增加 Windows 桌面控制工具。它通过 DSH 工具注册表接入官方电脑控制运行时，可列举应用和窗口、读取窗口截图与无障碍元素树，并按元素索引或坐标点击、输入文本、按键、滚动和拖拽。还可启动或聚焦应用、设置可编辑元素的值，并在操作结束后释放引擎。适合需要在本机 Windows 图形界面中查看和操作应用的场景；使用前需在机器上安装官方 @oai/sky 运行时。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/main.js:353-500","lib/main.js:693-720","lib/engine.js:206-285"]}
{"unit_id":"MuzeWinter__dscomputer-control#card-en","repo":"MuzeWinter/dscomputer-control","commit":"a4b36c59a1009c832c6ee738b540611d183ed446","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dscomputer-control adds Windows desktop tools to DSH using the installed @oai/sky runtime. It lists apps and windows, reads screenshots and accessibility trees, and supports clicks, typing, key combinations, scrolling, dragging, app launch, and value setting for local GUI tasks.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/main.js:353-500","lib/main.js:693-720","lib/engine.js:206-285"]}
