{"unit_id":"MuzeWinter__dscomputer-control#feature-1","repo":"MuzeWinter/dscomputer-control","commit":"a4b36c59a1009c832c6ee738b540611d183ed446","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dscomputer-control 的功能「查看窗口」：读取目标窗口的截图和无障碍元素树，并可将截图作为图片附件返回。通过 cua_window_state 调用，可选择是否包含截图或文本。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/main.js:409-443","lib/main.js:199-216"]}
{"unit_id":"MuzeWinter__dscomputer-control#feature-2","repo":"MuzeWinter/dscomputer-control","commit":"a4b36c59a1009c832c6ee738b540611d183ed446","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dscomputer-control 的功能「操作桌面」：在指定窗口中按元素索引或坐标点击，也可输入文字、按组合键、滚动、拖拽及设置可编辑元素的值。由对应 cua_* 工具调用。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/main.js:445-650"]}
{"unit_id":"MuzeWinter__dscomputer-control#feature-3","repo":"MuzeWinter/dscomputer-control","commit":"a4b36c59a1009c832c6ee738b540611d183ed446","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dscomputer-control 的功能「发现和启动应用」：列出桌面应用及窗口，或启动应用、聚焦指定窗口。先用列表工具取得应用或窗口标识，再调用启动或激活工具。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/main.js:378-408","lib/main.js:650-690"]}
{"unit_id":"MuzeWinter__dscomputer-control#feature-4","repo":"MuzeWinter/dscomputer-control","commit":"a4b36c59a1009c832c6ee738b540611d183ed446","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dscomputer-control 的功能「释放控制引擎」：调用 cua_release 关闭引擎并收起光标覆盖层；配置的空闲计时器也能在一段时间无调用后自动释放。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/main.js:253-299","lib/main.js:378-389"]}
{"unit_id":"MuzeWinter__dscomputer-control#caveat-1","repo":"MuzeWinter/dscomputer-control","commit":"a4b36c59a1009c832c6ee738b540611d183ed446","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dscomputer-control 使用前须知：运行依赖机器上已有的官方 @oai/sky 运行时；插件会查找其本地安装位置，未找到时无法创建客户端。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/engine.js:206-215","lib/engine.js:35-36"]}
{"unit_id":"MuzeWinter__dscomputer-control#caveat-2","repo":"MuzeWinter/dscomputer-control","commit":"a4b36c59a1009c832c6ee738b540611d183ed446","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dscomputer-control 使用前须知：控制窗口需要官方运行时及 Windows 桌面；变更操作可能切换前台焦点，运行结束可调用 cua_release 收起光标覆盖层。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/main.js:333-349","lib/main.js:378-389"]}
